    keySource: "source",
    explanation: "Create and reuse a conversation by storing its ID and providing that ID with later requests. The Foundry Agent Service associates the conversation with its complete thread history, including user and agent messages, tool calls, and tool outputs, so the service can automatically load prior context on each turn. Reusing the same conversation ID also allows the support case to continue across separate client sessions. Storing only final responses loses important interaction and tool history, while summarization does not replace the full conversation record."
