    explanation: "A retry evaluation checks the generated summary for completeness before it is returned to the user. If the response does not satisfy defined quality criteria, the application can prompt the agent again or regenerate the answer with additional context. This creates an application-level quality control loop. Decreasing max_tokens or using a smaller model would likely reduce completeness, while RAG addresses document grounding rather than validating whether an already generated response is complete."
